{
  "_comment": [
    "Third-party API bridges. When a Fabric API method is renamed between versions, add its entry",
    "here and Fox-Grade will rewrite call sites in the ported mod's bytecode to the new name.",
    "",
    "Pure renames only (same signature, same return type). For argument-type or return-type changes,",
    "a synthetic shim class is required \u2014 future work. Add such entries under a separate `shims`",
    "key once that machinery exists.",
    "",
    "Format:",
    "  renames: { \"<owner slash form>\": { \"<oldName>\": \"<newName>\" } }",
    "",
    "Grow this table the same way rules.json grows \u2014 from real failures observed in ported mods."
  ],
  "renames": {
